# Screenshots are outputs, not sources: `dtr --screenshot out.png` run in the
# repo must never end up in a commit. Logo renders are the deliberate exception
# (and they still go through LFS).
*.png
!assets/**/*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
**/tests/snapshots/**/*.diff.png
**/tests/snapshots/**/*.new.png
